      "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kY0WJ00RyEIfiJXR2yowysEWFt0oB46GXD8lc_gRdtpA=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
      "text": "Humans really will adapt to anything.",
      "likeCount": 1,
      "publishedAt": "2026-10-02T07:21:48Z",
      "replyCount": 1,
      "replies": [
        {
          "id": "UgzEeMumpSarrpme6id4AaABAg.AbSRo7YozndAbUzdQxGUCU",
          "author": "@Globallife.documentary",
          "authorImage": "https://yt3.ggpht.com/UT4yqZ2DrZ2fBIIQWOCcVrQYBje265v4HWuZn65ElT3j5IRtHyIw-Ezzb6kX6kLSxPFTaiT5EkE=s48-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj",
          "text": "It is genuinely awe-inspiring. Whether it means carving an entire town underground to escape 120° heat or building multi-story mud skyscrapers that withstand centuries of desert storms, human resilience always finds a way.",
          "likeCount": 0,
          "publishedAt": "2026-10-03T07:04:39Z"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
